{"4193830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Robot Space Frenzy", "steam_appid": 4193830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the robots on Space Station 451 have gone berserk! Only one human is left! Can she survive the onslaught and escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robot Space Frenzy is a lightning-paced casual boomer shooter with a focus on fast fun and simple, yet responsive controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193830/extras/0bf570301f3df12325cfeaba2d347d08.poster.avif?t=1775743430\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193830/extras/0bf570301f3df12325cfeaba2d347d08.webm?t=1775743430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193830/extras/0bf570301f3df12325cfeaba2d347d08.mp4?t=1775743430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through 10 levels, utilizing 5 powerful weapons against 6 deadly enemy types!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for keys, ammo, and health amongst the carnage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Groove to the sick beats of DavidKBD while the gorgeous palette of Petricake's tile work gets splattered with oil and robot viscera!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193830/extras/19cc488c9f8224b42d74479dc95755b3.avif?t=1775743430\" width=616 height=434 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEW EPISODE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In celebration of the Steam release, Robot Space Frenzy has been updated with an entirely new Second Campaign! You can access this second episode by selecting New Game in the Main Menu, then choosing the new content in the Chapter Select level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193830/extras/6b134bc3b3a1cb506d85e0078adda4c0.avif?t=1775743430\" width=616 height=434 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This chapter adds five challenging new levels, plus a new weapon and completely new enemy type, in addition to the common variant of the original game's Armored Cargo Loader Boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a focus on open areas and massive encounters, this episode is sure to provide a challenge for anyone looking for more Robot Space Frenzy fun!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the robots on Space Station 451 have gone berserk! Only one human is left! Can she survive the onslaught and escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robot Space Frenzy is a lightning-paced casual boomer shooter with a focus on fast fun and simple, yet responsive controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193830/extras/0bf570301f3df12325cfeaba2d347d08.poster.avif?t=1775743430\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193830/extras/0bf570301f3df12325cfeaba2d347d08.webm?t=1775743430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193830/extras/0bf570301f3df12325cfeaba2d347d08.mp4?t=1775743430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through 10 levels, utilizing 5 powerful weapons against 6 deadly enemy types!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for keys, ammo, and health amongst the carnage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Groove to the sick beats of DavidKBD while the gorgeou